  "implementation_notes": [
    "The federation is an inventory and adapter-discovery layer, not a secret store and not an automatic right to transact.",
    "Public does not mean unrestricted: many APIs require keys, OAuth, subscription, institutional agreements or explicit user consent.",
    "World/space/unknown horizons are modeled as scope and reality states. No extraterrestrial or alien API is asserted as factual; future/unknown connectors remain candidates until evidence exists.",
    "Directory indexes are the mechanism for continuously discovering the much larger public-API universe rather than pretending a fixed hand-curated list can remain complete."
  ]
